{
    "id":  10885,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "50W LED Streetlight FRIGG - CHIP LUMILEDS 140Lm/W",
    "reference":  "90611-4K",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e50W FRIGG LED\u003c/strong\u003e streetlight is made with a high luminosity \u003cstrong\u003eSMD2835 LUMILEDS\u003c/strong\u003e diode, which is capable of generating great illumination in any outdoor space of public lighting. It is time to replace the old streetlights with new ones with LED technology and it is possible to reduce up to 80% in energy consumption.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003e50W LED Streetlight FRIGG - CHIP LUMILEDS\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo achieve better public lighting, the ideal is the new FRIGG Street Lamp, which stands out from the rest thanks to its 50W power - SMD2835 -LUMILEDS chip- achieving a quality luminaire. It is made of aluminum and PMMA of high quality and transparency, which is why it is ensured with a high resistance protection.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA great advantage of this lamppost is its extra-flat design, which prevents tree leaves or dirt from depositing on it, while minimizing its visual impact.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe FRIGG LED street light is of immediate ignition eliminating the annoying waiting times that leave entire areas in darkness when the power fails, creating insecurity among pedestrians.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShock resistance IK10.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn addition, thanks to its IP65 protection it is protected against any weather change, if its lighting function affects.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIts wide angle of light manages to reach a greater amount of space, achieving better lighting and more uniformity.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe FRIGG LED street lighting luminaire will allow you to maintain good lighting with a contained consumption. The cost of ownership is lower by not having starters or electronics to replace.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBuilt for a long life, the FRIGG LED street light has a 3-year warranty for its high quality power supply, durability and design.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt has a 60mm diameter round adjustable connector, fixing 2 pressure screws to the column. The same support also allows wall mounting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eApplications: 50W FRIGG LED Street Light - Chip LUMILEDS\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e    Street lighting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e    Gardens and paths\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e    Parks and squares\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e    sports Center\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e    Parking lots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
